    "date": 1746532348,
    "caption": "🔥FUTURE INNOVATORS STEM HACKATHON🔥\n\n11 teams of girls and boys aged 14 to 19 gathered for the FUTURE INNOVATORS STEM HACKATHON, which took place on April 29 at American Corner Kostanay – a day filled with creativity, teamwork, and bold ideas to make STEM education more interactive and inspiring. It was a space where STEM technologies met creativity, proving that innovation is born at the intersection of logic and imagination.\n\nThe hackathon was held in partnership with Qostanai Hub, whose support and mentorship helped empower young minds to think boldly and act confidently. Together, we created an environment where ideas turned into real prototypes.\n\n🥇 1st place – to Team QWERTY with their interactive game ATOMIX, turning complex science into exciting gameplay.\n🥈 2nd place – to Team FOR HER, who created a STEM-themed Telegram bot quest with character choices and dynamic tasks.\n🥉 3rd place – to Team BEAUTY & BRAINS, who developed a Telegram bot to help students dive into the world of STEM learning.",
